{"5095030":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"Colorizing: Sunrise","steam_appid":5095030,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"controller_support":"full","dlc":[5095250],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Colorizing: Sunrise is a calming and easy-to-play color-by-numbers game for people of all ages.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This digital coloring book is a wonderful way to relax and lift your spirits.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is suitable for children and adults — everyone can enjoy coloring pixel by pixel.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game includes 150 diverse pictures to color.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will love bringing these beautiful pictures to life!<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy the simple pleasure of coloring pixels and watching each picture come to life. Whether you’re looking for a cozy coloring game to unwind with or simply love pixel coloring, there’s always another picture waiting for your finishing touch.<\/p>","about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Colorizing: Sunrise is a calming and easy-to-play color-by-numbers game for people of all ages.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This digital coloring book is a wonderful way to relax and lift your spirits.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is suitable for children and adults — everyone can enjoy coloring pixel by pixel.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game includes 150 diverse pictures to color.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will love bringing these beautiful pictures to life!<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy the simple pleasure of coloring pixels and watching each picture come to life. Whether you’re looking for a cozy coloring game to unwind with or simply love pixel coloring, there’s always another picture waiting for your finishing touch.<\/p>","short_description":"A relaxing color-by-numbers game with a wide variety of pictures for every taste. Enjoy the simple pleasure of coloring pixels and watching each picture c